OL,3,AUnis are offering degrees in content
OL,4,Acreation for #30,000. But are they
OL,5,Aworth it?
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs university courses go it may raise a
OL,8,Ffew eyebrows, but Destiny McGowan has
OL,9,Fno doubt that hers was very useful.
OL,11,FIn July the 21-year-old graduated from
OL,12,FNottingham Trent University with a
OL,13,Fdegree in content creation.
OL,15,FAs well as teaching how to best make
OL,16,Fvideos and posts for Instagram, TikTok
OL,17,Fand YouTube, the course also focused on
OL,18,Fhow to build audiences, engage with
OL,19,Fbrands and monetise your content.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
