OL,3,AUnis are offering degrees in content
OL,4,Acreation for #30,000. But are they
OL,5,Aworth it?
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I always wanted to be an entrepreneur,
OL,8,Fso for me the course was about the
OL,9,Ftransferable skills that I believed I
OL,10,Fwould gain," says Destiny, pointing to
OL,11,Fboth the social media and business
OL,12,Faspects she was taught.
